{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28264","headline":"偶游石盎僧舍 · 杜牧","name":"偶游石盎僧舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敬岑草浮光，句沚水解脉。\n益郁乍怡融，凝严忽颓坼。\n梅纇暖眠酣，风绪和无力。\n凫浴涨汪汪，雏娇村幂幂。\n落日美楼台，轻烟饰阡陌。\n潋绿古津远，积润苔基释。\n孰谓汉陵人，来作江汀客。\n载笔念无能，捧筹慙所画。\n任辔偶追闲，逢幽果遭适。\n僧语淡如云，尘事繁堪织。\n今古几辈人，而我何能息。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28264.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28264","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}